<task id="023" project="spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Lazy Contact attribution (resolve-or-create by workforce oid on first attributed action)</title>
    <phase>P2 Access-control + entitlement</phase>
    <gate>blocked-until:021</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <status-note>2026-10-01 (UAC-r2 141 verifier fix round): marked completed as UAC-r2 141 step 10 instructed, because the CODE is delivered there. It is not yet LIVE: UAC-r2 141's manual gates (schema, acct claim, tenant setting, deploy) are pending, and the alternate-key-vs-field-security question is decided (UAC-r2 owner round 4 item 4, 2026-10-01: B2, the key on an unsecured mirror column sprk_externalobjectidkey; UAC-r2 notes/task-141-identity-binding.md §9). A consumer must treat the requester contact as possibly null until the gates run.</status-note>
    <completed-by>unified-access-control-r2 task 141 (2026-10-01, branch task/uac-r2-141)</completed-by>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
